        {
          "id": 2390679675,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@alagoutte, thank you for merging this PR.\nI’ve attached the [gobgp-pr.pcap](/uploads/4a7a7ee2bb29db30532b010499566606/gobgp-pr.pcap) captured using GoBGP.\n\nThe BGP Confederation Member TLV is included in the \"Local Node Descriptors TLV\" of the \"Link-State NLRI SRv6 SID NLRI\". ([epan/dissectors/packet-bgp.c#L13737](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/19258/diffs#cbc9efa311150d720534ca7400be6ee3b93f13d9_13726_13737) should have been named \"BGP Confederation Member TLV.\" I’ll create another PR later.)\n\n> also not missing update a value_string ?\n\nThe [BGP Confederation Member TLV](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc9086) only contains an ASN, so I think a value_string isn’t needed.",
